Package: universal-java-installer
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${python3:Depends},
         python3 (>= 3.9),
         python3-gi,
         gir1.2-gtk-4.0,
         gir1.2-adw-1,
         policykit-1 | polkitd,
         ca-certificates
Recommends: default-jre | openjdk-21-jre
Description: Install and manage Java versions on any Linux distribution
 Graphical (GTK4/libadwaita) manager for OpenJDK and Oracle JDK runtimes.
 OpenJDK builds are installed through the native package manager (apt, dnf or
 pacman); Oracle JDK archives are downloaded directly from Oracle after the
 user accepts Oracle's licence and are verified against Oracle's published
 SHA-256 checksum. Nothing from Oracle is redistributed.
 .
 Fork of pardus-java-installer, portable beyond Pardus.
